AI features i would like but need to flesh out a bit

[ ] Better conversation control
	[ ] Add a /role command to switch the assistant behavior
	[ ] Allow changing the role only when the current response is finished
	[ ] Show the active role in the status bar
	[ ] Export and import the active role with conversations

[ ] Better tool use
	[ ] Show tool progress while the model is working
	[ ] Make permission requests more explicit for every tool
	[ ] Show the complete command before asking for permission
	[ ] Add a clear explanation when a tool is denied
	[ ] Make /tools display the active role policy

[ ] Better subagents
	[ ] Add a /subagents command
		[ ] list active and finished subagents
		[ ] open a subagent conversation
		[ ] close or shutdown a subagent
	[ ] Make nested subagents inherit safe tool permissions
	[ ] Show when a subagent is waiting for user input

[ ] Better model and server support
	[ ] Add Ollama server support
	[ ] Use token counts returned by the server when available
		[ ] llamacpp / ollama / openrouter
	[ ] Support servers that expose several models
	[ ] Allow switching models without restarting the conversation
	[ ] Preserve server command behavior while extracting commands

[ ] Better context handling
	[ ] Make context limits visible in the status bar
	[ ] Improve automatic compaction feedback
	[ ] Allow the user to inspect the effective context sent to the model
	[ ] Add a way to trim or summarize old messages manually

[ ] Better reliability
	[ ] Do not let one tab's workspace change affect another tab
	[ ] Prevent stale generation results after changing roles
	[ ] Make conversation import transactional
	[ ] Validate saved roles and settings before loading them
	[ ] Add tests for concurrent generation, permissions, and subagents

BUGFIXES

[ ] Tool permission decisions should use typed results instead of parsing messages
[ ] Server command errors should always be shown in the chat
[ ] Permission prompts should never look like the application has frozen
[ ] Long commands and tool arguments should remain readable in narrow windows

----------------------------

[ ] SKILLS.md Support (!important)

[ ] /model command to change / add models like /permissions
[ ] /theme command akin to /permissions to change the theme at runtime and create / edit themes
[ ] support dockerfile / podman for containers
